ve ensures that you don’t lose anything you’re currently working on.","saveButtonPopupBackupsTitle":"Backups: %{0}","siteMenu":{"title":"Pages and navigation","description":"Manage every page of your website here","mainNavigation":"Main navigation","noMainPages":"No pages or links in main navigation","addMainPage":"Drag and drop here or unhide it in settings","otherPagesSubtitle":"Your visitors and search engines can access these pages, but they won't appear in the main navigation.","hiddenFromNavigation":"Hidden from navigation","hiddenFromNavigationDescription":"These pages are accessible through search engines and URLs but do not appear in your navigation.","noHiddenPages":"No hidden pages or links","addHiddenPages":"Drag and drop pages or hide them in Page settings.","showInNavigation":"Show in navigation","hideFromNavigation":"Hide from navigation","moveToDropdown":"Move to dropdown","moveOutOfDropdown":"Move out of dropdown","emptyDropdown":"This dropdown is empty","emptyDropdownSubtitle":"Drag and drop pages to this dropdown","otherPages":"Other pages"},"multilingualDrawerTitle":"Languages","multilingualDrawerDescription":"Add multiple languages to your site so visitors can browse in their language.","multilingualDrawerDefaultLangDescription":"Default language is used first when visitors access your site.","multilingualDrawerRemoveLanguageModalTitle":"Remove language","multilingualDrawerRemoveLanguageModalText":"Are you sure you want to remove %{0} language and all its content? You cannot undo this action.","multilingualDrawerDuplicateModalTitle":"Add %{0} language","multilingualDrawerDuplicateModalText":"New languages will duplicate content from your website's starting language %{0}","multilingualDrawerDuplicateModalTextSlot":"(this works best when you have a finished website in your starting language.)","multilingualDrawerMakeDefault":"Make default","multilingualDrawerDefault":"Default","multilingualDrawerAddLanguage":"Add language","multilingualDrawerSetStartingLang":"Select starting language","multilingualDrawerHelpSteps":{"selectStartingLanguage":"Select the starting language of your website.","setupOriginal":"New languages will duplicate content from your website's starting language (this works best when you have a finished website in your starting language.)","fullControl":"Customize and edit the content of each new language."},"multilingualDrawerTranslationsDisclaimer":"All added languages require manual translation, and online store pages are not translatable.","editableItemsList":{"dragToMove":"Drag to move","placeholder":"Drop it here"},"sectionSettings":{"title":"Section settings"},"appointmentSectionSettings":{"title":"Appointments settings"},"emptyPage":{"title":"This page is empty","subtitle":"Click \\"Add section\\" below or use the %{0} menu on the left to start building this page","subtitleSlot":"Add elements"},"featureLock":{"bannerMessage":"Upgrade to the Business plan to use all AI and eCommerce features.","upgradeModalTitle":"Upgrade to the Business plan to use this feature","upgradeModalDescription":"AI tools and eCommerce features are available to Business plan holders only."},"AIWriter":{"title":"AI Writer","descriptionV3":"Create content of any length, style, or tone. Paste it into a text element to edit or enhance with AI."},"aiTextEditor":{"titleV2":"AI Writer","backButton":"Back","generate":"Generate","generating":"Generating...","stopGenerating":"Stop generating","copyText":"Copy Text","discard":"Discard","tryAgain":"Try Again","useThis":"Use this","you":"You","textCopied":"Text copied to clipboard.","errorView":{"heading":"We couldn't generate your content","description":"Check that you're connected to the internet and try again in a minute.","close":"Close","tryAgain":"Try again"},"idleView":{"placeholder":"For example, \\"Write a catchy description for my product or service.\\""},"discardModal":{"title":"Discard generated content?","description":"If you'd like to keep it, copy the text or use it on your site.","cancel":"Cancel"},"operationOptions":{"rephrase":"Rephrase","lengthen":"Lengthen","shorten":"Shorten","checkGrammar":"Check Grammar","changeTone":"Change Tone","createText":"Create text"},"toneOptions":{"professional":"Professional","enthusiastic":"Enthusiastic","casual":"Casual","confident":"Confident","funny":"Funny"}},"AIWebsiteBuilder":{"brandNameInputLabel":"Brand name","descriptionInputPlaceholder":"For example: ‘I run a bakery. I want a clean, modern website with earthy tones and an online store for selling my cakes and pastries.’","descriptionQualityLabelBad":"Try to be descriptive for best results!","descriptionQualityLabelGood":"Great description!","qualityLabelBad":"Good start, aim to be more descriptive","qualityLabelMedium":"Good effort, almost a great description","buttonCreateWebsite":"Create a website","addOnlineStore":"Add online store to my site","addAppointments":"Add and enable Appointments to my site","pills":{"business":{"label":"Create a business website","prompt":"Create a modern, high-growth business website for a Digital Solutions Agency.  Visual Style: Use Navy Blue for trust and Electric Blue for accents.\\n\\nKey Features: Please include a clear Value Proposition (Problem vs. Solution). Add a section for Trust Signals like client logos, awards, or certifications. The primary CTA should be \\"Request a Free Audit\\" or \\"Book Consultation\\". Include a section for Case Studies to prove ROI.\\n\\nRequired Pages:\\n • Home: Hero section with a strong tagline.\\n • Services: List offerings like Web Design, SEO, & Branding.\\n • About: Company mission and team.\\n • Work: Portfolio of past projects.\\n • Contact: Inquiry form and location map."},"onlineStore":{"label":"Create an online store","prompt":"Create a chic and high-end online fashion store for my brand \\"Lumina Apparel\\".\\nAim for a luxury visual style. For buttons and accents, use Classic Black or Rose Gold.\\nWhat to include:\\n • A products list section to showcase trends.\\n • A Gallery for lifestyle photos.\\n • Catalog categories for Men and Women.\\n • Add a section telling the story behind the brand and its fabric quality.\\n • Ensure Terms & Conditions and social links are in the Footer.\\nThe Pages:\\n • Home: Include a Hero section with a \\"Shop Now\\" CTA.\\n • Shop: The main catalog page.\\n • About: For the brand story.\\n • Contact: For customer support."},"portfolio":{"label":"Design a portfolio","prompt":"Design a minimalist and elegant portfolio for a Freelance Photographer. Website Name: \\"Visionary Lens\\". Colors: Primary Color: Charcoal Grey. Secondary Color: Soft White.\\n\\nThe website should function as a digital gallery, putting the visual work front and center.\\nThe Homepage needs a full-width hero section and a brief artist statement.\\nOrganize the Work section into clear categories (e.g., Portraits, Events).\\nInclude an About page to share my artistic background.\\n\\nSitemap:\\n • Home (Hero + Featured Shots)\\n • Work (Gallery)\\n • About (Bio)\\n • Contact (Form + Subscription)"},"appointments":{"label":"Launch an appointments website","prompt":"Create a modern and calming appointments website for a Massage Therapy Studio located in San Diego, CA.\\nMy business is called \\"Zenith Wellness\\"\\nI want the site to feel trustworthy and nature-inspired. For the buttons and highlights, use Soft Green or Earthy Beige.\\nKey Features:\\n • A \\"Book Now\\" button in the first section of the homepage.\\n • Display 5-star reviews prominently to build trust.\\n • Clear social media links so clients can connect with us easily.\\nPage Structure:\\n • Home: Hero section with a strong value proposition and call-to-action.\\n • About: Introducing the therapist and their experience.\\n • Bookings: A clear list of available appointment types and services with prices to choose from.\\n • Contact: Contact form, Google Maps location, and business details."},"blog":{"label":"Start a blog","prompt":"Create a modern and easy-to-read blog website for sharing articles and updates named \\"AI News\\". The website should include:\\n • A homepage featuring a clean layout, highlighted recent posts, and CTAs like \\"Read More\\" and \\"Subscribe\\".\\n • A Blog page with posts displayed in a simple list or grid\\n • Individual blog post pages\\n • An About page introducing the author and the blog's purpose.\\n • A Contact page with a simple contact form."},"restaurant":{"label":"Launch a restaurant website","prompt":"Create a mouth-watering website for a Modern Asian Fusion restaurant called \\"Golden Ginger\\". \\nThe design should use Deep Red and Gold accents to feel elegant and appetizing. \\nI need a homepage featuring high-quality food photography, a fully responsive Digital Menu with prices, and clear calls-to-action to \\"Order Online\\" or \\"Reserve a Table.\\" \\nInclude essential details like Opening Hours, a Google Map integration, and a section for Customer Reviews. \\nPlease organize the page structure yourself to help hungry customers find us and book quickly."},"onePager":{"label":"Create a one pager website","prompt":"Create a modern one-page website to present my personal brand in a clear and engaging way. The website should include:\\n • A hero section with a strong headline and CTAs like \\"Get Started\\" and \\"Contact Me\\".\\n • An About section with a short intro dedicated to my brand and key highlights.\\n • A Testimonials section to build credibility.\\n • A Contact section with a simple form, key details, and social links.\\nThe website should be fully responsive, easy to scroll on mobile, and visually consistent throughout."}}},"AIWebsiteBuilderFormWeddingBrandName":"Couple's names","AIWebsiteBuilderFormWeddingBrandNamePlaceholderV2":"Olivia & Jacob","AIWebsiteBuilderFormDescriptionWeddingPlaceholder":"We, Olivia & Jacob, are getting married on July 12th. The ceremony will take place at 11 AM at St. Patrick's Cathedral, followed by a celebration at Le Bernardin restaurant...","AIWebsiteBuilderFormTitleV2":"Let AI create a website for you","AIWebsiteBuilderTemplateFormTitle":"Personalize text and images faster with AI","AIWebsiteBuilderTemplateFormUseOriginalButton":"Use original template","AIWebsiteBuilderTemplateFormUseTemplateButtonMain":"Personalize template","AIWebsiteBuilderFormBrandPlaceholder":"Enter brand name","AIWebsiteBuilderFormDescription":"Description","AIWebsiteBuilderPreviewFormTitle":"Create another website version","AIWebsiteBuilderPreviewFormSubtitle":"Last 5 versions of your site are saved in version history.","AIWebsiteBuilderWelcomePreMadeTemplates":"Pre-made templates","AIWebsiteBuilderWelcomeLinkInBioText":"Link in bio website","AIWebsiteBuilderNewTitle":"Let AI create your online presence","AIWebsiteBuilderNewPlaceholderV2":"Describe your website or business...","AIWebsiteBuilderNewImproveDescription":"Improve description","AIWebsiteBuilderNewOr":"OR","AIWebsiteBuilderChangeTemplateModalWarning2":"All your content will be deleted","AIWebsiteBuilderChangeTemplateModalInfo0":"This action will permanently delete:","AIWebsiteBuilderChangeTemplateModalInfo1":"All your content in current website","AIWebsiteBuilderChangeTemplateModalInfo2":"Online store (if you have one)","AIWebsiteBuilderChangeTemplateModalQuestion":"Are you sure you want to change the template?","AITextGeneratorInputPlaceholderV2":"Write one paragraph for an About Us page of a yoga studio. Keep the tone friendly.","AITextGeneratorPopupDailyLimitReachedDisclaimer":"Daily usage limit reached.","AITextGeneratorLoadingText":"Creating...","AITextGenerationStopped":"The AI text generation process has been stopped","AITextGenerationFailed":"An error occurred while generating text","AITextGenerationDescriptionNotClear":"Please provide a clearer description","publishStatusFetchError":"Error occurred while fetching website publish status","publishStatusPublishingMessage":"Publishing your changes...","publishStatusPublishing